flowchart TB
  accTitle: Where the jobs run and which hosts they reach
  accDescr: The jobs event, apply, sweep, sync-labels and findings run on ubuntu-24.04 behind Harden-Runner in block mode, without sudo and containers, and reach api.github.com and github.com; findings also reaches GitHub's results service, results-receiver.actions.githubusercontent.com, for the cache of the alerts that it reported. The job attachments runs there too, without the AI and with a read-only token, and reaches api.github.com, github.com, GitHub's three hosts of the storage of attachments and the results service of its artifact. The job analyze runs on ubuntu-24.04-firewall and reaches the hosts of .github/egress-firewall.yaml. Every other host is blocked for all of them.
  subgraph blocked ["ubuntu-24.04, Harden-Runner: block, no sudo, no containers"]
    writers["`**event**, **apply**, **sweep**,<br>**sync-labels**, **findings**<br>no AI, a write token`"]
    attachments["`**attachments**<br>no AI, a read-only token`"]
  end
  subgraph firewall ["ubuntu-24.04-firewall, GitHub's egress firewall"]
    analyze["`**analyze**<br>the AI, a read-only token`"]
  end
  writers --> github[("api.github.com<br>github.com")]
  writers -. "findings: the cache of<br>the reported alerts" .-> cache[("results-receiver.<br>actions.githubusercontent.com")]
  attachments --> github
  attachments --> storage[("GitHub's storage of attachments:<br>objects, private-user-images and<br>user-images.githubusercontent.com")]
  attachments -. "the artifact of<br>the attachments" .-> cache
  analyze --> hosts[("the hosts of<br>egress-firewall.yaml")]
  writers --x other(["every other host"])
  attachments --x other
  analyze --x other
  classDef ai fill:#8250df33,stroke:#8250df,stroke-width:2px
  classDef job fill:#8c959f1f,stroke:#8c959f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef safe fill:#1a7f3726,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:2px
  classDef untrusted fill:#cf222e26,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:2px
  class analyze ai
  class writers,attachments job
  class github,hosts,cache,storage safe
  class other untrusted
